wanted to say i love the way you draw Duo's together! your art looks amazing! \n\nUpon finding your art, it made me really wanna Request one for my friend (Allusunday)  and I (Lulu Megurine)\n\nthese are our characters\n\nAllusunday: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_5Dhl8jVLMCaI6y4w7TGbHkJ4_nVkfB5\n\nLulu: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zbp4sLyYdHwYOMgCW9-10ihvI8BliM5q?usp=drive_link\n\nI was hoping you could make one where lulu looks somewhat annoyed or fired up while allusunday looks a little smug or somewhat pleased, either standing side by side or back to back!  we've always had this type of dynamic and i would really like to capture that type of feeling with your art\n\nThank you so much for your consideration!\n\nPs I was having trouble resending the points earlier so I had to cancel and make a new request I\u2019m sorry! But I hope this is good!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@orcacat8/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3835079, "client_id": 1826165, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=575ecd7e3831afbbcf3e89d8928f94f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=575ecd7e3831afbbcf3e89d8928f94f5, https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42d7d4fe53dc83dbbf3d89944aa4ee0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0119d354/uploads/origins/8c1cc943-12d5-4bfd-b9cf-957e1b10a445?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a772fc3f27105b27052078a453f8ce1d 3x"}, "duration": null, "